<http://data.silknow.org/event/663878a0-154b-3b13-9772-f4f18365eab3>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased. Registered File number 1985/68. With a front fall that reaches from the left to the right hip, instead of a fly, in an old-fashioned style. Apart from the falls this is a fashionable pair of trousers with a high waistline and a high back waist."@en ;
